# Phase 8 part B: cluster storage (docs/plans/cluster.md sections 5 and 6.1).
# The storage role configures LIO through configfs from hardyd-priv; targetcli
# stays only for diagnostics (no saveconfig.json: the target is rebuilt from
# root's own state at boot).
targetcli-fb
# Compute nodes: iSCSI initiator (node.startup manual: logins only when the
# cluster grants them), optional multipath, NFSv4.2 client.
open-iscsi
multipath-tools
nfs-common
sg3-utils
# Moving an app's data between its NFS folder and its block volume on the
# storage node; block volumes are ext4 or xfs.
rsync
e2fsprogs
xfsprogs
# Phase 8 part C: the live-migration channel is narrowed with libvirt's
# polkit access driver (decision 351; vms.migrate.setup refuses without it).
polkitd
